1153	/// `message.content` seeds the snapshot. `content_block_start` APPENDS a block whatever its index;
1154	/// deltas and stops look up `content[event.index]` by Python list indexing. An `input_json_delta`
1155	/// for a `tool_use` or `server_tool_use` block is appended to a buffer keyed by `event.index` and
1156	/// partial-parsed into `input`. A `message_delta` writes `snapshot.usage.output_tokens`, so a
1157	/// `message_start` without a `usage` object makes it raise (checked against 2.3.0 by the
